§ RunEvalTraceFixture

-- Fixture for the "Trace:" section of `l4 run`: one #EVAL and one #EVALTRACE
-- over the same call, so the two blocks can be compared side by side.
-- The #EVALTRACE block must show its trace; the #EVAL block must go on saying
-- that none was captured.

GIVEN x IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE doubleNot x IS NOT NOT x

#EVAL doubleNot TRUE
#EVALTRACE doubleNot TRUE
